# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As long as the Qiskit C API has not yet reached feature parity with its Python API, some components of this package remain exclusive to its Python API, too. This includes the entire circuit library ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")) as well as transpiler passes ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"
msgstr "Mientras la API de C de Qiskit no haya alcanzado la paridad de funciones con su API de Python, algunos componentes de este paquete seguirán siendo exclusivos de su API de Python. Esto incluye toda la biblioteca de circuitos ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")), así como los pases del transpilador ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"

